Meta.documentation:httpConnection.route
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Routes accepted connections - two modes, chosen by the URI tail.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:PATH GATE httpConnection.route:<path>?method=GET - the identifier is the
Meta.documentation:request path (leading "/" optional), ?method= selects the method
Meta.documentation:(default GET). On match the gate fires out_go - downstream starts
Meta.documentation:without a value, exactly like Boolean.if's go. On no-match the gate
Meta.documentation:stays silent and the connection answers itself the default at out_end.
Meta.documentation:Host logic deliberately lives in a separate guard element, not here.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:VIA MOUNT connection.route:<scheme>:<base> - reached through a var
Meta.documentation:reference (that is what wires the per-request capture feed, see var's
Meta.documentation:subscription). The identifier is a URI prefix (e.g. file:public): the
Meta.documentation:captured connection's request path completes it (file:public + /x ->
Meta.documentation:file:public/x?read), the resource loads through the dawn tree and the
Meta.documentation:result streams out on out_response - the static-mount pattern ("/"
Meta.documentation:serves index.html, ".." answers 403, a miss stays silent so the
Meta.documentation:connection answers itself 204, GET/HEAD only). The scheme is free - any
Meta.documentation:loadable scheme (http: later) mounts the same way.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_httpConnection_$all - an accepted httpConnection (request meta on its .value)
Meta.documentation:@port out_go - gate mode: fired when method and path match the URI
Meta.documentation:@port out_response - via mode: the loaded reply (or a verbatim {__dawnResponse} record)
Meta.documentation:@see httpConnection
Meta.documentation:@see httpServer
Meta.documentation:@see var
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental
[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20httpConnection.route%20%E2%80%94%20two%20modes%2C%20chosen%20by%20the%20URI%20tail%3A%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20PATH%20GATE%20%20httpConnection.route%3A%3Cpath%3E%3Fmethod%3DGET%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20The%20identifier%20is%20the%20request%20path%20(a%20leading%20%22%2F%22%20is%20optional)%3B%20the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20optional%20%3Fmethod%3D%20parameter%20selects%20the%20HTTP%20method%20(default%20GET).%20On%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20match%20the%20gate%20fires%20out_go%20(no%20value%20%E2%80%94%20downstream%20starts%20exactly%20like%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20Boolean.if's%20go)%3B%20on%20no-match%20it%20stays%20silent%2C%20leaving%20the%20connection%20to%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20answer%20itself%20the%20default%20at%20out_end.%20Host%20logic%20deliberately%20lives%20in%20a%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20separate%20guard%20element%2C%20not%20here%20(user%20decision%202026-10-15).%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20VIA%20MOUNT%20%20connection.route%3A%3Cscheme%3E%3A%3Cbase%3E%20%20%20(reached%20through%20a%20var%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20reference%20%E2%80%94%20that%20is%20what%20wires%20the%20per-request%20capture%20feed%2C%20see%20var's%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20subscription).%20The%20identifier%20is%20a%20URI%20prefix%20(e.g.%20file%3Apublic)%3A%20the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20captured%20connection's%20request%20path%20completes%20it%20(file%3Apublic%20%2B%20%2Fx%20-%3E%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20file%3Apublic%2Fx%3Fread)%2C%20the%20resource%20is%20loaded%20through%20the%20dawn%20tree%20and%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20the%20result%20streams%20out%20on%20out_response%20%E2%80%94%20the%20static-mount%20pattern%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20(%22%2F%22%20serves%20index.html%2C%20%22..%22%20answers%20403%2C%20a%20miss%20stays%20silent%20so%20the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20connection%20answers%20itself%20204%2C%20GET%2FHEAD%20only).%20The%20scheme%20is%20free%3A%20any%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20loadable%20scheme%20(http%3A%20later)%20mounts%20the%20same%20way.%0Afunction%20route()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22route%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20routeProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20routeProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_go%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_response%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20URI%20tail%3A%20%3Cpath%3E%3Fmethod%3DGET%20(gate)%20or%20%3Cscheme%3E%3A%3Cbase%3E%20(via%20mount)%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09let%20tail%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20tail%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(tail)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%7D%0A%09%09let%20q%20%3D%20tail.indexOf(%22%3F%22)%3B%0A%09%09let%20head%20%3D%20(q%20%3D%3D%20-1%20%3F%20tail%20%3A%20tail.slice(0%2C%20q))%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20a%20scheme-ish%20head%20(%22file%3Apublic%22)%20selects%20the%20via%20mount%3B%20a%20path%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20(%22environment.json%22)%20selects%20the%20gate%0A%09%09if%20(%2F%5E%5BA-Za-z%5D%5BA-Za-z0-9%2B.-%5D*%3A%2F.test(head))%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09newObject.viaURI%20%3D%20head%3B%0A%09%09%09newObject.routePath%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09newObject.routeMethod%20%3D%20%22GET%22%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09else%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09newObject.viaURI%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09newObject.routePath%20%3D%20head%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(newObject.routePath.indexOf(%22%2F%22)%20%3D%3D%200)%0A%09%09%09%09newObject.routePath%20%3D%20newObject.routePath.slice(1)%3B%0A%09%09%09newObject.routeMethod%20%3D%20%22GET%22%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(q%20!%3D%20-1)%0A%09%09%09%09for%20(const%20part%20of%20tail.slice(q%20%2B%201).split(%22%26%22))%0A%09%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09%09const%20eq%20%3D%20part.indexOf(%22%3D%22)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(eq%20%3D%3D%20-1)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(decodeURIComponent(part.slice(0%2C%20eq))%20%3D%3D%20%22method%22)%0A%09%09%09%09%09%09newObject.routeMethod%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(part.slice(eq%20%2B%201)).toUpperCase()%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_httpConnection_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09%7B%20const%20cr%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.get_resource)%20%3F%20input.get_resource()%20%3A%20input%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09if%20(resource.viaURI)%20return%20this.via(input)%3B%0A%09%09return%20this.gate(input)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20gate%20mode%3A%20match%20method%20%2B%20path%2C%20fire%20out_go%20on%20match%3B%20the%20downstream%0A%09%2F%2F%20chain's%20promise%20(Dawn-promise%20continuation)%20is%20awaited%20so%20async%20work%0A%09%2F%2F%20(http%20fetches)%20completes%20before%20the%20request%20end%20event%20propagates%0A%09this.gate%20%3D%20async%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20meta%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.get_resource)%20%3F%20input.get_resource().value%20%3A%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!meta)%20return%3B%0A%09%09if%20(String(meta.method%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).toUpperCase()%20!%3D%20resource.routeMethod)%20return%3B%0A%09%09const%20urlPath%20%3D%20String(meta.url%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).split(%22%3F%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09if%20(urlPath%20!%3D%20%22%2F%22%20%2B%20resource.routePath)%20return%3B%0A%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20this.out_go%3F.()%3B%0A%09%09if%20(r)%20%7B%20if%20(r.promise)%20await%20r.promise()%3B%20else%20await%20r%3B%20%7D%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20via%20mount%3A%20complete%20the%20via%20URI%20with%20the%20request%20path%2C%20load%20through%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20dawn%20tree%2C%20stream%20the%20result%20into%20the%20reply%20(out_response)%0A%09this.via%20%3D%20async%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20meta%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.get_resource)%20%3F%20input.get_resource().value%20%3A%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!meta%20%7C%7C%20typeof%20meta.url%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22undefined%22)%20return%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20static%20mounts%20answer%20reads%20only%20(express.static%20parity)%3B%20anything%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20else%20falls%20through%20and%20the%20connection%20answers%20itself%20204%0A%09%09const%20method%20%3D%20String(meta.method%20%7C%7C%20%22GET%22).toUpperCase()%3B%0A%09%09if%20(method%20!%3D%3D%20%22GET%22%20%26%26%20method%20!%3D%3D%20%22HEAD%22)%20return%3B%0A%09%09let%20p%20%3D%20String(meta.url).split(%22%3F%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20p%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(p)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%20return%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09if%20(p%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22%2F%22%20%7C%7C%20p%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22%22)%20p%20%3D%20%22%2Findex.html%22%3B%0A%09%09if%20(p.split(%22%2F%22).indexOf(%22..%22)%20!%3D%3D%20-1)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09this.out_response%3F.(%7B%20value%3A%20%7B%20__dawnResponse%3A%20%7B%20status%3A%20403%2C%20contentType%3A%20%22text%2Fplain%22%2C%20body%3A%20%22Forbidden%22%20%7D%20%7D%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%09return%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09let%20inst%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20inst%20%3D%20await%20Dawn.instanciate_processor().lookup(resource.viaURI%20%2B%20p%20%2B%20%22%3Fread%22)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%20inst%20%3D%20null%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09if%20(!inst%20%7C%7C%20!inst.connect)%20return%3B%0A%09%09const%20replyFn%20%3D%20this.out_response%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!replyFn)%20return%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20relay%3A%20loaded%20values%20flow%20into%20the%20reply%3B%20lifecycle%20(begin%2Fend)%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20and%20the%20error%20channel%20stay%20unbound%20-%20a%20begin%20must%20never%20answer%20the%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20connection%2C%20and%20a%20miss%20answers%20204%0A%09%09const%20relay%20%3D%20%7B%20offer_connection%3A%20function(match)%20%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(match%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22error%22%20%7C%7C%20match%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22begin%22%20%7C%7C%20match%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22end%22)%20return%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20replyFn%3B%0A%09%09%7D%20%7D%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20inst.connect(relay)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%20return%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09inst.in_begin%3F.()%3B%0A%09%09try%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20r%20%3D%20inst.in_go%3F.()%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(r)%20%7B%20if%20(r.promise)%20await%20r.promise()%3B%20else%20await%20r%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%7D%0A%09%09inst.in_end%3F.()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0Aroute.Processor%20%3D%20routeProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%20%3D%20route%3B%0A]>>NewResource:httpConnection.route
